{f} | ${ws.name} R${rNum}] ${rowStr.substring(0, 120)}`);\\n              }\\n            });\\n          });\\n        });\\n      }\\n    } catch(e) {\\n      // ignore\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nsearchInOldFiles().catch(console.error);\\n\"","Description":"\"Search target company names in old Desktop files\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\a97462f9-3976-4927-b799-281f20134eb3\\\\scratch\\\\search_old_files.js\"","toolAction":"\"Searching old files\"","toolSummary":"\"Create search_old_files.js\""}}]}
